        "video_size": "large",
        "heading": "Style with Purpose",
        "text": "<p>In 2020, we launched LOOP IN—our social good platform—rooted in a simple but powerful idea: when women come together, small actions create meaningful change.</p><p>LOOP IN was created to connect LOOPERS with opportunities to give back—to \"loop in\" not just through what we wear, but through how we show up for our communities.</p><p>Each year, our LOOPin Grant Program supports nonprofit organizations nominated by our Looper Community—organizations doing vital, often unseen work to uplift, protect, educate, and empower.</p><p><strong>This past Giving Tuesday, you showed up in a big way.</strong> Thanks to your nominations and support, we proudly awarded <strong>5 LOOPin Grants</strong> to this year's extraordinary recipients—each one a reflection of a cause close to a Looper's heart.</p><p>Every grant tells a story. Every nomination reflects a cause close to someone's heart. Together, they form a growing circle of impact.</p><p>Our mission remains simple: to inspire LOOPERS to help make the world a better place—one intentional act at a time.</p><p><strong>The next LOOPin Grant cycle opens in September.</strong> Start thinking about the organizations in your community that deserve to be in the loop—and get ready to nominate.<br/><a href=\"/pages/about-us\" title=\"About us\">Learn More About Our Mission</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://laloop.com/collections/shop-all\" title=\"https://laloop.com/collections/shop-all\">Shop to Support</a></p>",
